{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490341-diabolists-bene-ashmedai-2e-conversion","id":1490341,"title":"Diabolists (Bene Ashmedai 2e Conversion)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-15T19:51:57-07:00","id":1490341,"title":"Diabolists (Bene Ashmedai 2e Conversion)","content":"<u><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bene Ashmedai</span></span></u><br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Diabolists </i></span></span></i><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pages 156-159 of The Silver Ladder for lore</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Doctrine and Magic</span></span></b><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Parent Path:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mastigos</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Parent Order:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Silver Ladder</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisites:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Spirit 2, Mind 1, Language (Hebrew), Meditative Mind Merit 1, Persuasion 2 and one of the following additional skills at 2 dots or higher: Empathy, Expression, Intimidation, Occult or Subterfuge.</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Initiation: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The mage, or another member of the legacy, summons the goetia of one of the mage\u2019s vices, the mage must struggle with and bind the demon to their will.</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ruling Arcana:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Spirit</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Yantras:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Succeed on a Persuasion roll relevant to the spell (+2), your spell is cast in the service of others (+1), your spell is in keeping with your Vice (+1, +2 if this imposes a negative Condition). </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Oblations:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Acting as a guru or other spiritual authority, building up or tearing down a celebrity, conversing with goetic demons or other goeticists, demonological research, engaging in seduction (either as the initiator or as the pursued), giving in to Vice without concern for the consequences or inspiring another to do so, indulging in the fear and/or adulation of others, psychoanalyzing oneself or others.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attainments</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>First Attainment: Demonic Nature</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisites: Initiation</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The first thing diabolists learn is to identify the strengths and weaknesses of the demons they encounter. This attainment allows the mage to ask a number of questions about an ephemeral entity equal to potency as an instant action. The following questions can be asked:</span></span><ul><li>What is the spirit\u2019s name?</li> <li>What is its rank?</li> <li>What manifestations does it possess?</li> <li>What numina does it posses?</li> <li>What are its influences, and roughly how strong are they?</li> <li>What is its ban or bane?</li> </ul><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">If the mage has mind 1 they add \u201cWhat is its vice?\u201d to the list of questions they can ask and gain the ability to ask the following questions about none ephemeral entities:</span></span><ul><li>What is their vice?</li> <li>How many mental dots do they have?</li> <li>How many social dots do they have?</li> </ul><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Second Attainment: Diabolist's Circlet</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisites: Spirit 2, Persuasion 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Before advancing farther in the legacy the Bene Ashmedai learn to protect themselves from the demons they will face. By meditating for an hour they invoke a ward against the magic of demons. This attainment functions as \u201cEphemeral Shield\u201d (Spirit 2, MtAw 181) with reach for advanced duration.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Mind 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The demons of the fallen world come in many forms, therefore the diabolists must shield themselves on multiple fronts. This attainment is activated with the same meditation as above and functions as \u201cMental Shield\u201d (Mind 2, MtAw 160) with reach for advanced duration.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Third Attainment: Daimon's Measure</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisites: Spirit 3, The optional skill used to meet the requirements of initiation must be raised to 3 or a second option from the list must be raised to 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In order to rule their demons the Bene Ashmedai must be able to engage them. After spending an hour in meditation the Diabolist is able to physically interact with the demons hiding in twilight. This attainment functions as \u201cGossamer Touch\u201d (Spirit 2, MtAw 181) with the mind two effects to allow the spell to effect Goetia and with reach for advanced duration and the ability to physically interact with Goetia and Spirits in twilight.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Mind 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bene Ashmedai learn to put their demons in check with this attainment. After an hour of meditation the mage is able to silence their own demons. This attainment functions as \u201cClear Thoughts\u201d (Mind 3, MtAw 161) with reach for advanced duration.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Fourth Attainment: Pandemonium's Mirror</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisites: Spirit 4, Persuasion 4</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">It is time for the mage to learn to bind their demons to themselves. With an hour long ritual and a willing spirit the mage is able to bind themselves to a demon and vice versa. This attainment functions as \u201cFamiliar\u201d (Spirit 4, MtAw 183) with reach assigned to advanced duration and if the mage has Mind 4 the mage can target a goetia instead of a spirit.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Mind 4</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The demons within the mages mind or the minds of others are now the diabolists to summon. After an hour of meditation the mage is able to call a demon from their own Oneiros, and if need be, the Oneiros of someone else. This attainment functions as \u201cGoetic Summons\u201d (Mind 3, MtAw 162) with reach for advanced duration and too allow the spell to target goetia within the Oreiros of the mage or another target. This attainment costs a mana to use unless it is being activated where the diabolist could normally enter the astral. </span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fifth Attainment: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Demonic Banishment</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisites: Sirit 5, The optional skill used to meet the requirements of initiation must be raised to 4 or a second option from the list must be raised to 3 or a third option must be raised to 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A diabolist must learn to banish unwanted demons back to where they belong. In an hour-long ritual they are able to banish demons. This attainment functions as \u201cBanishment\u201d (Spirit 4, MtAw 182) with reach for advanced durations and the specific reach effect to prevent the spirit from recreating the conditions until the duration of the attainment finishes and can affect goetia if the mage has Mind 4 per the spell effect.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Mind 5</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">After an hour-long ritual the Diabolist is able to chain the demons within the minds of themself or others, completely stopping their influence and giving other demons a chance to gain their influence within. This attainment functions as \u201cAmorality\u201d (Mind 5, MtAw 164) with reach for advanced duration. </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26284,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","user":"Aendrinastor","date":". 04-02-2023, 02:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-15T19:58:06-07:00","id":1490342,"title":"","content":"Hey all, made this for two purposes, one, My Hierarch in a setting I'm working on will probably be a member.<br /> Second, a PC I'm playing will probably be a member as well, so I finished out this draft of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T00:03:14-07:00","id":1490355,"title":"","content":"I might point out that the familiar spell only last as long as both parties are consenting. Doesn't really sound like a binding spell to me. <br /> <br /> I would swap it out for Bind Spirit - which forces the spirit into a manifestation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T07:28:08-07:00","id":1490392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490341-diabolists-bene-ashmedai-2e-conversion?p=1490355#post1490355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I might point out that the familiar spell only last as long as both parties are consenting. Doesn't really sound like a binding spell to me.<br /> <br /> I would swap it out for Bind Spirit - which forces the spirit into a manifestation.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Familiar spell is consistent with their methodology. The Bene Ashmedai diverge from the Clavicularius in the fact that they entreat their vices, in this way they hope to gain their cooperation when something important happens. The Clavicularius would use Command Spirit, Bind Spirit and entrap them in fetishes (such as bottles inscribed with the Seal of Solomon) using Solomonic magic to establish themselves as their commander by occult power and strength of character. Whereas the Bene Ashmedai would instead enjoy the benefits of their willing cooperation, such as independent action, a mana and Essence channel, higher access to the ephemeral being's powers and the ability to share information via the links.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-16-2022, 10:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T13:13:41-07:00","id":1490431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aendrinastor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490341-diabolists-bene-ashmedai-2e-conversion?p=1490342#post1490342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all, made this for two purposes, one, My Hierarch in a setting I'm working on will probably be a member.<br /> Second, a PC I'm playing will probably be a member as well, so I finished out this draft of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>May I recommend the book <i>Grimoire of Grimoires</i> ? It has two called <i>The Key of Brass &amp; Flame</i> and <i>The Final Spell Of Eli Ben-Menachem</i>, both of which provide interesting Mysteries focused on goetic magic. There is also another called <i>The Ialdabaoth Codex</i>, which focuses on binding Abyssal demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-16-2022, 04:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T14:37:03-07:00","id":1490443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490341-diabolists-bene-ashmedai-2e-conversion?p=1490431#post1490431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> May I recommend the book <i>Grimoire of Grimoires</i> ? It has two called <i>The Key of Brass &amp; Flame</i> and <i>The Final Spell Of Eli Ben-Menachem</i>, both of which provide interesting Mysteries focused on goetic magic. There is also another called <i>The Ialdabaoth Codex</i>, which focuses on binding Abyssal demons.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'll look into it, goetic and abyssal demons are hella interesting to me and the PC I'm playing, thanks for the recommendation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}